  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Democracy and Respect for Fundamental Human Rights of Prisoners in Liberia, Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;OO: To contribute to strengthen democracy and the respect of fundamental human rights for most vulnerable detainees in Liberia&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;SO: Enhancing access to and equity before the law for pre-trial detainees and inmates while supporting improved conditions of the correctional system in Nimba, Bong, Margibi and Grand Cape Mount Counties&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
